---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
---

<BaseLayout title="页面未找到" description="请求的页面不存在。" noindex>
  <section class="error-page shell">
    <p class="error-page__code" aria-hidden="true">404</p>
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">页面未找到</p>
      <h1>这里没有可读的内容。</h1>
      <p>链接可能已经失效，也可能输入有误。你可以返回首页，或搜索现有文章。</p>
      <div class="button-row">
        <a class="button button--primary" href="/">返回首页</a>
        <a class="button button--secondary" href="/search/">搜索文章</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
